151 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 110 0 R
/E (The KL Hospital Priority Management System is designed to manage and organize patients based on their medical priority using Priority Scheduling. The system helps prioritize patients so that those requiring urgent attention can be handled first. It includes patient registration, priority assignment, doctor details, doctor availability, and room allocation. The system also helps identify available doctors and rooms, making the treatment and admission process more organized. Overall, the project aims to improve patient management, resource allocation, and efficient hospital operations.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
