/S /P
/P 111 0 R
/E (Priority-based management is important in hospitals to ensure that patients are attended to according to the urgency of their condition. Priority Scheduling assigns a priority level to each patient and helps determine the order of treatment. This project applies Priority Scheduling to hospital management, along with doctor details, doctor availability, and room allocation. It helps organize patient care and manage hospital resources efficiently.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
